   "reason": "The Dragon's attack set is queen rays plus knight squares, so detonating her is the largest blast in the game (attack set + ring 2 at T4+); the pair converts the game's shortest-lived summon into an immediate room clear plus a 2-3 turn stun. | Freeze pins the king in place for tier+1 turns and Vanguard drops a body that may take him inside that window — the freeze alone cannot reach him and the knight alone cannot catch a fleeing king.",
   "winningPairs": [
