   "anchors": [
    "rewind+twin",
    "page+smoke"
   ],
   "reason": "The Twin is the strongest body per charge and the most hunted (enemies value a rook ally at major-piece level); Rewind is the only card that gives her back. | Smoke stops the hunt for Rookie and the king's reactions while the Page walks; his captures do not break her cover, so the slowest body in the game gets a quiet window.",
